{"version":1,"content":"<p>據X功能研究員Aaron發佈的演示，X似乎正在開發一項「撤銷」按鈕功能，允許用户在意外刷新「為你推薦」信息流後，返回刷新前的瀏覽位置。當用户刷新時間線時，屏幕底部會出現一個小的「撤銷」按鈕；點擊後，系統將恢復此前的信息流，讓用户回到剛才停留的位置。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587732.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T02:43:55.437752+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:27:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_hash":"5ded690eee91320a7ba74568d7007645a967843496b7df0b97d23d2b8a01ecbb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}